  {
   "id": "h-options-hint",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 144.24,
   "y": 460.0,
   "width": 491.20000000000005,
   "height": 18.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1310444345,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1115210338,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "2\u20133 real options; the current proposal is only one of them",
   "originalText": "2\u20133 real options; the current proposal is only one of them",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optA",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 40,
   "y": 489.0,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 454.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 185707817,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 348216466,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "adr-optA-text"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optA-text",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 46,
   "y": 495.0,
   "width": 468,
   "height": 320.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 198951483,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1987151421,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "A. One step, typed numbers\n\nHow it works: a person pastes EU CT numbers; a sync\nfetches the record and the documents and reads their\npages; checks run on whatever has pages.\n\nPros:\n\u2022 simple\n\u2022 already built\n\nCons:\n\u2022 no view of what a source holds\n\u2022 CTIS-only code and flags\n\u2022 a partly failed sync still looks ready for a check\n\nMark (current state)",
   "originalText": "A. One step, typed numbers\n\nHow it works: a person pastes EU CT numbers; a sync\nfetches the record and the documents and reads their\npages; checks run on whatever has pages.\n\nPros:\n\u2022 simple\n\u2022 already built\n\nCons:\n\u2022 no view of what a source holds\n\u2022 CTIS-only code and flags\n\u2022 a partly failed sync still looks ready for a check\n\nMark (current state)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-optA",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optB",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 550,
   "y": 489.0,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 454.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   },
   "seed": 1204451460,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 2023960738,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "id": "adr-optB-text"
    }
   ],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optB-text",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 556,
   "y": 495.0,
   "width": 468,
   "height": 440.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1472500626,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 623039801,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "B. Registered sources, two stages\n\nHow it works: core.source names the adapter that\nreads a source and holds its config (what to list,\nwhat evidence to transfer). Syncing the list makes\nevery listed trial a trial here (key, title,\nidentifiers). Transferring evidence fetches a chosen\ntrial's record and configured documents and reads\ntheir pages, recorded as complete or failed. Checks\nrun only on complete trials.\n\nPros:\n\u2022 browse and choose before paying for downloads\n\u2022 one flow for every source\n\u2022 no check on missing evidence\n\u2022 stale evidence is visible\n\nCons:\n\u2022 the whole list is stored before any trial is read\n\u2022 more tables and states\n\nMark (proposal)",
   "originalText": "B. Registered sources, two stages\n\nHow it works: core.source names the adapter that\nreads a source and holds its config (what to list,\nwhat evidence to transfer). Syncing the list makes\nevery listed trial a trial here (key, title,\nidentifiers). Transferring evidence fetches a chosen\ntrial's record and configured documents and reads\ntheir pages, recorded as complete or failed. Checks\nrun only on complete trials.\n\nPros:\n\u2022 browse and choose before paying for downloads\n\u2022 one flow for every source\n\u2022 no check on missing evidence\n\u2022 stale evidence is visible\n\nCons:\n\u2022 the whole list is stored before any trial is read\n\u2022 more tables and states\n\nMark (proposal)",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-optB",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "adr-optC",
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1060,
   "y": 489.0,
   "width": 480,
   "height": 454.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#868e96",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
