   "updated": 1763726400000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Decided with the user on 2026-11-21: syncing a source means getting its list of trials (id, name) mapped into our trials; evidence is transferred as each source's\nconfig says; checks run only on trials whose evidence was transferred (downloaded and read). The live-search page (C) was proposed first and dropped.\n\nAmended 2026-11-21 after a code review: stale evidence no longer counts as checkable (a sponsor's corrected document would be judged by its old copy). A check reads\na trial only when every source that holds it has a complete, current transfer that brought the document kinds the check reads; a stale trial is transferred again first (sources/stages.py, not_ready).",
   "originalText": "Decided with the user on 2026-11-21: syncing a source means getting its list of trials (id, name) mapped into our trials; evidence is transferred as each source's\nconfig says; checks run only on trials whose evidence was transferred (downloaded and read). The live-search page (C) was proposed first and dropped.\n\nAmended 2026-11-21 after a code review: stale evidence no longer counts as checkable (a sponsor's corrected document would be judged by its old copy). A check reads\na trial only when every source that holds it has a complete, current transfer that brought the document kinds the check reads; a stale trial is transferred again first (sources/stages.py, not_ready).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": "adr-notes",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
